{
  "file": "common childhood",
  "page": 55,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        124.79139709472656,
        27.289522171020508,
        328.7294006347656,
        35.34652328491211
      ],
      "text": "6. EVIDENCE FOR RECOMMENDATIONS FOR TREATMENT OF PNEUMONIA",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 7.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        59.74208068847656,
        399.0615539550781,
        73.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "One open-label RCT compared oral levofloxacin with oral co-amoxiclavulanic",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        72.74208068847656,
        399.122802734375,
        86.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "acid. The study involved 708 children (including 270 children < 5 years), with",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        85.74208068847656,
        399.13287353515625,
        99.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "infiltrates on chest X-ray and at least two clinical indicators of pneumonia. There",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        98.74208068847656,
        399.0528259277344,
        112.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "was no difference in cure rate at 10–17 days after completing treatment for children",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        111.74208068847656,
        314.2228088378906,
        125.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "< 5 years between the two groups (RR 1.02, 95% CI 0.93 to 1.11).",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        124.74208068847656,
        399.111572265625,
        138.23208618164062
      ],
      "text": "Two RCTs involving 393 children compared azithromycin with co-amoxiclavulanic",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        137.74208068847656,
        399.0928039550781,
        151.23208618164062
      ],
      "text": "acid in children with chest X-ray and clinical findings of pneumonia. Treatment",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        150.74208068847656,
        399.11273193359375,
        164.23208618164062
      ],
      "text": "failure at 2 weeks was not significantly different between groups (RR 1.20, 95% CI",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        163.7421112060547,
        109.56291198730469,
        177.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "0.45 to 3.21).",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        176.7421112060547,
        399.0414733886719,
        190.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "One study from Chile of 47 children between 1 month and 14 years with X-ray and",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        189.7421112060547,
        399.0929870605469,
        203.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "clinical signs suggestive of classical bacterial pneumonia compared oral azithromycin",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        202.7421112060547,
        399.07281494140625,
        216.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "and oral amoxicillin. Children receiving azithromycin normalised their chest X-ray",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        215.7421112060547,
        399.0627746582031,
        229.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "on day 7 significantly more often than those treated with amoxicillin (p<0.009).",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        228.7421112060547,
        375.10296630859375,
        242.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "However, clinical response on days 3, 7, and 14 were not significantly different.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        241.7421112060547,
        396.86151123046875,
        255.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "One open-label RCT involving 100 children aged 2 months to 12 years with non-",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        254.7421112060547,
        399.0829162597656,
        268.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "severe pneumonia in Nigeria compared amoxicillin with co-amoxyclavulanic acid.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        267.7420959472656,
        399.1226501464844,
        281.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "Cure rates were better with co-amoxiclavulanic acid (OR 10.44, 95% CI 2.85 to 38.21);",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        280.7420959472656,
        257.6629638671875,
        294.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "however, allocation concealment was inadequate.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        293.7420959472656,
        399.0512390136719,
        307.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "An open randomized multi-centre study involving 68 children aged 2–16 years",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        306.7420959472656,
        399.02294921875,
        320.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "with radiologically proven pneumonia compared oral azithromycin with oral",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        319.7420959472656,
        399.1128845214844,
        333.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "erythromycin. There was no significant difference in clinical success or adverse",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        332.7420959472656,
        100.15290069580078,
        346.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "outcomes.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        354.2361145019531,
        280.69293212890625,
        366.3760986328125
      ],
      "text": "Aetiology and antibiotic susceptibility [Grant et al, 2009]",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Obli",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        367.24609375,
        399.0729675292969,
        380.7361145019531
      ],
      "text": "Aetiological data comes from studies of inpatients with severe pneumonia. The",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        380.1161193847656,
        399.1174621582031,
        393.7361145019531
      ],
      "text": "Streptococcus pneumoniae Haemophilus  common bacterial pathogens are   (17–37%),",
      "font": "MinionPro-It",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        393.1161193847656,
        399.1025390625,
        406.7361145019531
      ],
      "text": "influenzae Staphylococcus aureus  (0–31%) and   (1–33%). Approximately 25% of",
      "font": "MinionPro-It",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        406.24609375,
        333.512939453125,
        419.7361145019531
      ],
      "text": "community acquired pneumonia has a positive viral diagnostic test.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        419.24609375,
        399.12152099609375,
        432.7361145019531
      ],
      "text": "Given that there are limited data on the aetiology of non-severe pneumonia,",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        432.24609375,
        399.10302734375,
        445.7361145019531
      ],
      "text": "antibiotics have been targeted at the pathogens known to cause severe pneumonia.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        445.24609375,
        399.1128845214844,
        458.7361145019531
      ],
      "text": "There are limited data on the effect of antibiotic resistance in pneumonia. There are",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        458.24609375,
        399.1029357910156,
        471.7361145019531
      ],
      "text": "data showing in-vitro resistance to co-trimoxazole correlating with poor clinical",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        471.24609375,
        399.0527648925781,
        484.7361145019531
      ],
      "text": "outcome in acute otitis media. Although the trial by Strauss et al showed higher failure",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        484.24609375,
        399.1029968261719,
        497.7361145019531
      ],
      "text": "rate for children with severe pneumonia receiving co-trimoxazole as compared to",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        497.24609375,
        304.41290283203125,
        510.7361145019531
      ],
      "text": "amoxicillin, it is not clear whether this was due to resistance.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        518.739990234375,
        131.68289184570312,
        530.8800048828125
      ],
      "text": "Treatment duration",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Obli",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        531.75,
        399.0829162597656,
        545.239990234375
      ],
      "text": "Four studies involving 6513 participants were identified that compared the same",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        544.75,
        399.1028747558594,
        558.239990234375
      ],
      "text": "antibiotic for different durations (3 days versus 5 days). Two studies compared",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        557.75,
        396.82293701171875,
        571.239990234375
      ],
      "text": "amoxicillin three times daily (30–50 mg/kg/day), and two studies compared co-",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        570.75,
        399.0628356933594,
        584.239990234375
      ],
      "text": "trimoxazole. All were randomized, double-blinded, placebo-controlled trials. Pooled",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        583.75,
        399.0727233886719,
        597.239990234375
      ],
      "text": "analysis found no difference in cure rates (RR 0.99, 95% CI 0.98 to 1.01, n=5892),",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        596.75,
        399.0426940917969,
        610.239990234375
      ],
      "text": "failure rates (RR 1.07, 95% CI 0.92 to 1.25, n=5892), and relapse rate (RR 1.06, 95% CI",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        609.75,
        331.91290283203125,
        623.239990234375
      ],
      "text": "0.82 to 1.37, n=2753) between long- versus short-duration treatment.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        223.55499267578125,
        644.9403076171875,
        231.48399353027344,
        655.2992553710938
      ],
      "text": "41",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    }
  ]
}